'''Horde of Cats''' (ネコたちの大逆襲, ''Neko Tachi no Dai Gyakushū'', '''Great Revenge of the Cats''') is an event added in the [[Version 13.2 Update]]. Like all [[Gauntlet]]s, progress made in Horde of Cats will reset when the event ends. The bosses of this Gauntlet are [[Killer Cat (Enemy)|Killer Cat]], [[Killer Tank Cat (Enemy)|Killer Tank Cat]], [[Killer Gross Cat (Enemy)|Killer Gross Cat]], and as of [[Version 15.2 Update|Version 15.2]], [[Killer Cowbird Cat (Enemy)|Killer Cowbird Cat]].

==Event Information==
With savage fury in their hearts, a horde of Cats marches on the Empire?!<br>
On 8/8, limited time Cat Day events return!<br>
A new limited Cat hero!

{{Color|#FF0000|'''On from August 8th (11:00am) until August 16th (10:59am)!'''}}

{{Color|#FF9900|'''● Limited Stage: HORDE OF CATS'''}}<br>
Cats who have fallen on the field of battle, reborn as Killer Cats?!<br>
This year features Cow Cat and Bird Cat!

Visit the Legend Stages/Event Stages during this event to test your Cats in these limited stages!

Get a very small chance to unlock an event-limited unit upon stage clear!<br>
Check below to see units available as drop rewards from each stage!

Stage 1, 3, 5: Killer Cat<br>
Stage 2, 4, 8: Killer Tank Cat<br>
Stage 6, 9, 11: Killer Gross Cat<br>
Stage 7, 10, 12: Killer Cowbird Cat

<nowiki>*</nowiki> Use a Treasure Radar for a 100% chance of unlocking the unit(s).<br>
<nowiki>*</nowiki> The unit(s) cannot be unlocked again if earned from a previous event.<br>
<nowiki>*</nowiki> The unit(s) above can be activated at the Upgrade menu once collected.

{{Color|#EA4335|'''・Earn up to 7 login stamps during the event!'''}}<br>
{{Color|#33AAAA|'''Reward(s): Rare Ticket, XP'''}}

