==Trivia==
*Horde of Cats, [[Horde of Tank Cats]], [[Horde of Cats (Old)]] and [[Aim GI Nyanko Horse Racing]] are currently the only [[Gauntlet]]s whose names in the [[Legend Stages]] menu are entirely white rather than yellow.
*Horde of Cats' Event Banners bear a striking resemblance to the fiery background of the [[Intro Cutscene]].
*Horde of Cats occurs on August 8th outside of the Japanese Version because that is the date of [[wikipedia:International Cat Day|International Cat Day]]. In the Japanese Version it occurs on February 22nd because that is [[wikipedia:National Cat Day#Japan|Japan's National Cat Day]].

